Description: lock screen wrapper around i3lock-color
 betterlockscreen pre-renders your wallpaper into blurred, dimmed and
 pixelated variants, caches them per resolution, and locks the screen with
 i3lock-color using the cached image. Locking is therefore instant rather
 than waiting on image processing. A clock, a text greeter and per-state
 ring colours are configurable, and a template systemd unit is included for
 locking on suspend.
